    "167 poly-layer shapes not part of any recognised nfet/pfet gate touch contact at 2+ separate points (the resistor-body signature) and carry no resistor-marker layer at all; this deck may not model the device class drawn here, and its terminals have been absorbed into ordinary interconnect as an unintended short -- see docs/cli/extract.md's 'Known limitation: unmodelled device geometry'.",
